265
00:11:39,040 --> 00:11:39,360
Hey, waiter.

266
00:11:40,040 --> 00:11:41,040
Okay.

267
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:42,040
Yeah.

268
00:11:42,040 --> 00:11:43,040
But in this case, like, Hey, how's it going?

269
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:44,040
Or hi.

270
00:11:44,040 --> 00:11:45,040
Yeah.

271
00:11:45,040 --> 00:11:46,720
So it's a really friendly and informal way of saying hi.

272
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:47,720
Okay.

273
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:49,620
And then he asked, how's it going?

274
00:11:50,440 --> 00:11:51,100
How's it going?

275
00:11:51,760 --> 00:11:54,080
So again, this is a way of saying, how are you?

276
00:11:54,400 --> 00:11:55,400
Yeah.

277
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:57,140
Marco, what's the correct answer to this greeting?

278
00:11:57,800 --> 00:12:00,770
Well, well, for example, he said, things are going great.

279
00:12:01,070 --> 00:12:01,290
Right.

280
00:12:01,670 --> 00:12:02,930
You can say, yeah, things are great.

281
00:12:03,050 --> 00:12:04,410
Or I'm doing well.

282
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:05,840
Yeah.

283
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:06,470
Or even great.

284
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:07,840
Great.

285
00:12:07,840 --> 00:12:08,840
Yeah.

286
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:09,840
So how's it going?

287
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:10,840
Oh, it's great.

288
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:11,840
Yeah.

289
00:12:11,840 --> 00:12:12,840
Right.

290
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:18,880
Now, another one that we didn't see in the dialogue, but it's very popular is when somebody asks, Hey, what's up?

291
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:19,110
Yeah.

292
00:12:19,230 --> 00:12:19,750
What's up?

293
00:12:20,090 --> 00:12:23,170
So again, what is the right way to answer this question?

294
00:12:23,410 --> 00:12:23,710
All right.

295
00:12:24,070 --> 00:12:26,050
So when somebody says, what's up?

296
00:12:26,230 --> 00:12:27,590
You can say, well, not much.

297
00:12:28,070 --> 00:12:34,130
Or if maybe you have news or something that you want to share, you would say, well, I just got back from the doctor's office.

298
00:12:34,560 --> 00:12:35,560
Yeah.

299
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:37,190
But you wouldn't say, fine, thank you.

300
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:39,250
Or you wouldn't say, very good.

301
00:12:39,720 --> 00:12:42,530
Or any of these other common answers to what's up.

302
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:43,600
That's right.

303
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:44,600
It can be a little bit tricky.

304
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:45,600
Yeah.

305
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:49,240
So the rule is, the normal thing to say when someone says, hey, what's up?

306
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,230
Is nothing much.

307
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:50,770
Not much.

308
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,600
Yep.

309
00:12:52,600 --> 00:12:53,600
All right.

310
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:54,720
So interesting ways of greeting casually with people, right?

311
00:12:54,740 --> 00:12:57,560
You wouldn't use this fully with your boss, maybe, or in an office setting.

312
00:12:57,820 --> 00:12:57,980
Yeah.

313
00:12:58,100 --> 00:12:59,640
More useful with your friends.

314
00:12:59,940 --> 00:13:00,200
Okay.

315
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:08,400
So if you have any other questions or have any other informal greetings that you would like to share with us, come to EnglishPod.com.

316
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:09,400
Yeah.

317
00:13:09,400 --> 00:13:14,020
Marco and I are always around to answer your questions and we look forward to hearing from you.

318
00:13:15,040 --> 00:13:15,240
So until next time.

319
00:13:16,040 --> 00:13:17,040
Bye.

320
00:13:17,040 --> 00:13:24,415
Bye.
